{"id":"gamefreak-staff-24","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【工作日志】2007年GAME FREAK特别名片","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"试用期结束成为正式员工后，蟹子收到了一张特别名片，并介绍了 GAME FREAK 独一无二的宝可梦名片制度。","date":"2007-09-06","publication":"晴れたり時々曇ったり · ゲームフリークの名刺","source":{"title":"晴れたり時々曇ったり · ゲームフリークの名刺","url":"http://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/staff/?p=24","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20130808162750/http://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/staff/?p=24","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[],"mentions":[],"works":[{"name":"宝可梦 红·绿","slug":"red-green"}],"tags":["Game Freak","Game Freak 员工","GF介绍","宝可梦","招聘"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":867,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-staff/entry-24/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/24/meisi01_s-e1919b8a.jpg","cover_kind":"own","size":[314,234],"lore":{"facets":{"pokemon":[{"name":"オムスター","ndex":139,"seg":[3,25,31,9],"as":["オムスター","多刺菊石兽"],"via":"body"}],"works":[{"name":"宝可梦 红·绿","slug":"red-green","seg":[11],"via":"entities"}],"people":[{"name":"カニ子","slug":null,"role":"mentioned","seg":[0],"via":"llm"}],"places":[],"concepts":[{"id":"illustration","name":"插画与设定图","facet":"art","seg":[8,14,16,30,36,38],"as":["插画","イラスト"],"via":"body"},{"id":"art-direction","name":"美术风格","facet":"art","seg":[14],"as":["美术设计"],"via":"body"},{"id":"collection","name":"收集与图鉴","facet":"system","seg":[20,21],"as":["集齐"],"via":"body"},{"id":"joining","name":"进公司之前","facet":"team","seg":[32,43],"as":["入社"],"via":"body"},{"id":"screen-look","name":"画面表现","facet":"art","seg":[36],"as":["グラフィック"],"via":"body"},{"id":"recruiting","name":"招聘与新人","facet":"team","seg":[],"as":["招聘"],"via":"tag"}]},"observations":[{"seg":9,"text":"カニ子的宝可梦是多刺菊石兽"},{"seg":13,"text":"规则是不能选已被其他人选走的宝可梦"}],"relations":[{"id":"gamefreak-staff-35","kind":"background","label":"为这篇提供背景","title":"【工作日志】2007年员工最爱的宝可梦","url":"/gamefreak-staff/entry-35/","why":"同系列工作日志，也讲名片上的宝可梦选择"}],"sources":{"pokemon_names":"2026-09-23","tour_places":"2026-09-23","model":"deepseek-chat","relations_model":"deepseek-chat","concepts":"2026-09-26"},"built":"2026-09-25","edited":false,"by_seg":{"3":{"dex":[139]},"25":{"dex":[139]},"31":{"dex":[139]},"9":{"dex":[139],"obs":0},"0":{"people":["カニ子"]},"11":{"works":["red-green"]},"8":{"concepts":["illustration"]},"14":{"concepts":["illustration","art-direction"]},"16":{"concepts":["illustration"]},"30":{"concepts":["illustration"]},"36":{"concepts":["illustration","screen-look"]},"38":{"concepts":["illustration"]},"20":{"concepts":["collection"]},"21":{"concepts":["collection"]},"32":{"concepts":["joining"]},"43":{"concepts":["joining"]},"13":{"obs":1}}},"archive_type":"gamefreak_legacy_blog","summary":"试用期结束成为正式员工后，蟹子收到了一张特别名片，并介绍了 GAME FREAK 独一无二的宝可梦名片制度。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div data-gf-language-panel=\"zh-CN\">\n你好！好久不见，我是カニ子（蟹子）。\n\n那么，时间过得真快，我的试用期也结束了，正式成为一名正式员工，<br>\n\n这周一，公司送给了我一样很棒的东西。\n\n<figure class=\"gf-legacy-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/24/meisi01_s-e1919b8a.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/24/meisi01_s-e1919b8a.jpg\" alt=\"オムスター\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure>\n\n锵锵！<br>\n\n我收到的东西，就是カニ子的名片。\n\n名片上会写着名字，所以每个人的名片各不相同是理所当然的，<br>\n\n但 GAME FREAK 的名片可不太一样。相当特别。\n\n每个人的名片上，都会有一幅专门为其绘制的不同宝可梦插画！<br>\n\nカニ子的宝可梦是多刺菊石兽。好可爱！\n\n加入 GAME FREAK 的人，<br>\n\n可以从宝可梦 红·绿中登场的<br>\n\n151种宝可梦里选择一种，印在自己的名片上。<br>\n\n规则是，不能选择已经被其他人选走的宝可梦。\n\n这些插画是 GAME FREAK 的美术设计师<br>\n\n专门为名片绘制的，<br>\n\n因此是世界上独一无二的插画。\n\n<figure class=\"gf-legacy-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/24/meisi02_s-579ec37b.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/24/meisi02_s-579ec37b.jpg\" alt=\"みんなの名刺\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure>\n\n这是其他员工的名片。<br>\n\n各有各的个性，很有意思！\n\n顺便一提，目前还没有集齐151种名片。<br>\n\n真期待新员工加入，集齐151种名片的那一天到来。<br>\n</div>\n\n<div data-gf-language-panel=\"ja\" hidden>\nこんにちは！ お久しぶりのカニ子です。\n\nさてさて、早いもので私も試用期間が終わり晴れて正社員となったので、<br>\n\n今週の月曜日に会社からステキなものを貰いました。\n\n<figure class=\"gf-legacy-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/24/meisi01_s-e1919b8a.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/24/meisi01_s-e1919b8a.jpg\" alt=\"オムスター\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure>\n\nじゃじゃーん！<br>\n\n貰ったもの、それはカニ子の名刺です。\n\n名刺は名前が書かれるものだから一人一人違うのは当たり前ですが、<br>\n\nゲームフリークの名刺はひと味違います。かなりスペシャル。<br>\n\n一人一人の名刺に違うポケモンイラストが書き下ろしなのです！<br>\n\nカニ子のポケモンはオムスター。かわいい！\n\nゲームフリークに入社した人は、<br>\n\nポケットモンスター 赤・緑に登場した<br>\n\n151種類のポケモンのうちの1種類を自分の名刺にすることができます。<br>\n\nルールとしては既に他の人が選んだポケモンを選ぶ事はできません。\n\nイラストはゲームフリークのグラフィックデザイナーが<br>\n\n名刺のためだけに書き下ろしてくれるものなので、<br>\n\n世界にひとつだけのイラストになっています。\n\n<figure class=\"gf-legacy-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/24/meisi02_s-579ec37b.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/24/meisi02_s-579ec37b.jpg\" alt=\"みんなの名刺\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure>\n\n他のスタッフの名刺です。<br>\n\n個性豊かでたのしい！\n\nちなみに、まだ151種類の名刺は集まっていません。<br>\n\n新入社員さんが入って来て、151種類集まる日が来るのが楽しみです。\n\n<br>\n</div>","markdown_ja":null}}